                                            "%d, alphabet size: %d", i, repeatCount, alphabetSize)
                    );
                }

                Arrays.fill(codeLengths, i, i + repeatCount, repeatSymbol);
                i += repeatCount - 1;
            }
        }

        return codeLengths;
    }

